              "correct": true,
              "text": "Ethanoic acid is reduced to ethanol by LiAlH<sub>4</sub>; propene is not reduced by LiAlH<sub>4</sub> and needs H<sub>2</sub>/Pt or Ni."
            },
            {
              "key": "D",
              "correct": false,
              "text": "Reaction 2 does work: reducing a carboxylic acid to a primary alcohol is a standard use of LiAlH<sub>4</sub>."
            }
